{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"997","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Good Subsegments"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"7 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A permutation $$$p$$$ of length $$$n$$$ is a sequence $$$p_1, p_2, \\ldots, p_n$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ distinct integers, each of which from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq p_i \\leq n$$$) ."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call the subsegment $$$[l,r]$$$ of the permutation "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if all numbers from the minimum on it to the maximum on this subsegment occur among the numbers $$$p_l, p_{l+1}, \\dots, p_r$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, good segments of permutation $$$[1, 3, 2, 5, 4]$$$ are:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 1]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 3]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 5]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2, 2]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2, 3]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2, 5]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[3, 3]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 4]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 5]$$$, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[5, 5]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a permutation $$$p_1, p_2, \\ldots, p_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to answer $$$q$$$ queries of the form: find the number of good subsegments of the given segment of permutation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In other words, to answer one query, you need to calculate the number of good subsegments $$$[x \\dots y]$$$ for some given segment $$$[l \\dots r]$$$, such that $$$l \\leq x \\leq y \\leq r$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 120000$$$) — the number of elements in the permutation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ distinct integers $$$p_1, p_2, \\ldots, p_n$$$ separated by spaces ($$$1 \\leq p_i \\leq n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains an integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq q \\leq 120000$$$) — number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$q$$$ lines describe queries, each line contains a pair of integers $$$l$$$, $$$r$$$ separated by space ($$$1 \\leq l \\leq r \\leq n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a $$$q$$$ lines, $$$i$$$-th of them should contain a number of good subsegments of a segment, given in the $$$i$$$-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n1 3 2 5 4\n15\n1 1\n1 2\n1 3\n1 4\n1 5\n2 2\n2 3\n2 4\n2 5\n3 3\n3 4\n3 5\n4 4\n4 5\n5 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n2\n5\n6\n10\n1\n3\n4\n7\n1\n2\n4\n1\n3\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"997E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/997/problem/E"}